        "description": "<p>As a general rule, Mawali provide a helpful word and occasional political pushes or cover, but they don’t fight your battles or call in valuable favors. If they must do so for their own sake to aid you, you probably lose a dot or more of this Background, after arousing their ire. Characters can also acquire one-off Minor Boons (p. 315) from other Kindred, only during character generation. These boons cost half the points (rounded up) of the equivalent Mawla.</p><p>• Neonate</p><p>•• Ancilla</p><p>••• Elder</p><p>•••• Primogen or Anarch Revolutionary Council member</p><p>••••• Prince or Baron</p>",
