  "system": {
    "activeForm": "homid",
    "appearance": "<p>Claudette is tall, nearly 6’2” and lanky. She is covered in tattoos, all she had done prior to her undeath. The tattoos are flowers of every variety. Her arms are covered in roses and clematis, her neck is twining iris tattoos, Claude’s legs have marigolds, dahlias, and orchids. Her back covered in lotuses. Her hair is cut short, in sharp angles, to her chin. She is often dressed in slacks, button shirt rolled at the to the elbows with many pens in the breast pocket. She carries a pocket notebook that allows her to take quick notes about whatever she’s currently learning about.</p>",
